title: mf trash list
tags: [[CLI command]] Trash
kind: reference
summary: List the trashed files (id, size, age, reason, original path)

One row per entry, newest first: the entry id (what `mf trash restore` takes),
the size, the age, the reason (`manual`, `rollback`, `sync`) and the path it was
trashed from — a trailing `/` marks a directory.
